{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cozy Forge: Blacksmith Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3432920,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/0027c3a1c67d36bf570be15fc2a9fbf9.poster.avif?t=1754320688\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/0027c3a1c67d36bf570be15fc2a9fbf9.webm?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/0027c3a1c67d36bf570be15fc2a9fbf9.mp4?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BLACKSMITH SIMULATOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cozy Forge, blacksmithing is neither a tiring ordeal nor overly simplistic it's just right. Melt your raw materials, pour them into molds, hammer them on the anvil, and polish them if needed. But don\u2019t worry you don\u2019t have to be a master smith to enjoy it. You'll discover the art of blacksmithing naturally, without being overwhelmed. Cozy Forge combines a Cozy atmosphere with simple and intuitive interactions to create a pleasant experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/1f02b8c77c32624c4221d0e8593cde5f.poster.avif?t=1754320688\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/1f02b8c77c32624c4221d0e8593cde5f.webm?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/1f02b8c77c32624c4221d0e8593cde5f.mp4?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERYONE NEEDS YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your workshop isn\u2019t just for crafting sickles, horseshoes, or hammers for villagers. One day, a knight preparing for battle might ask for a sturdy sword. The next day, a king might honor your humble forge with a request for a royal accessory. Who you serve and the quality of your work is entirely up to you. In Cozy Forge, every task turns into a story shaped by your craftsmanship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/b8a61bc766bfc18e14912d952182bdd2.poster.avif?t=1754320688\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/b8a61bc766bfc18e14912d952182bdd2.webm?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/b8a61bc766bfc18e14912d952182bdd2.mp4?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A COZY MEDIEVAL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We blend the historical texture of medieval chronicles with modern Cozy design principles. Cozy Forge integrates medieval art with today\u2019s cozy game spirit, aiming to deliver both visually and emotionally satisfying gameplay. From item designs to character illustrations, every detail is crafted with this vision in mind. We're sure you'll feel like you're truly living in a medieval town!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/0027c3a1c67d36bf570be15fc2a9fbf9.poster.avif?t=1754320688\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/0027c3a1c67d36bf570be15fc2a9fbf9.webm?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/0027c3a1c67d36bf570be15fc2a9fbf9.mp4?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BLACKSMITH SIMULATOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cozy Forge, blacksmithing is neither a tiring ordeal nor overly simplistic it's just right. Melt your raw materials, pour them into molds, hammer them on the anvil, and polish them if needed. But don\u2019t worry you don\u2019t have to be a master smith to enjoy it. You'll discover the art of blacksmithing naturally, without being overwhelmed. Cozy Forge combines a Cozy atmosphere with simple and intuitive interactions to create a pleasant experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/1f02b8c77c32624c4221d0e8593cde5f.poster.avif?t=1754320688\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/1f02b8c77c32624c4221d0e8593cde5f.webm?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/1f02b8c77c32624c4221d0e8593cde5f.mp4?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERYONE NEEDS YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your workshop isn\u2019t just for crafting sickles, horseshoes, or hammers for villagers. One day, a knight preparing for battle might ask for a sturdy sword. The next day, a king might honor your humble forge with a request for a royal accessory. Who you serve and the quality of your work is entirely up to you. In Cozy Forge, every task turns into a story shaped by your craftsmanship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/b8a61bc766bfc18e14912d952182bdd2.poster.avif?t=1754320688\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/b8a61bc766bfc18e14912d952182bdd2.webm?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432920/extras/b8a61bc766bfc18e14912d952182bdd2.mp4?t=1754320688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A COZY MEDIEVAL EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We blend the historical texture of medieval chronicles with modern Cozy design principles. Cozy Forge integrates medieval art with today\u2019s cozy game spirit, aiming to deliver both visually and emotionally satisfying gameplay. From item designs to character illustrations, every detail is crafted with this vision in mind. We're sure you'll feel like you're truly living in a medieval town!</p>",
    "short_description": "Cozy Forge is a cozy medieval sim where you run a blacksmith shop. Melt, mold, and forge tools for townsfolk be it a sickle for a peasant or a sword for a knight. Lose yourself in the relaxing rhythm of your forge.",
